WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
This is for people who care about the work that I&nbsp;
do. I want to tell you about the Newsroom, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.240
is just a fancy title for our Patreon, where you&nbsp;
get a lot of fun things and you can simultaneously&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.660
support what we're doing around here. What is it&nbsp;
that we're doing around here? Oh, you know, just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:18.240
low key, trying to change how journalism is done.&nbsp;
I left Vox in 2019 to start doing journalism on my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.940
own, and now we are at 3 million subscribers. I&nbsp;
used “we” because it's no longer just me. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.860
now a big team of very talented people who make&nbsp;
all of this happen. To do really good journalism,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:33.180
more and more, we need to rely on support from the&nbsp;
community. So that's where the newsroom comes in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.660
You help support independent journalism, and&nbsp;
the good thing is you get something in return.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.380
Every month we do a behind the scenes vlog where&nbsp;
you get to meet the people behind the scenes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:45.120
see our processes, see a lot of shenanigans. It's&nbsp;
a really good time. But you also get to weigh in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:49.680
on the thumbnails and the titles that we choose.&nbsp;
Even story ideas, you get access to my scripts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.220
the full, uncut interviews that I do with&nbsp;
experts. And every month you get a music&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.640
track from our composer, Tom Fox, that you can&nbsp;
use in your own videos. So go check out the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.880
newsroom. If it's not your thing, that's fine&nbsp;
if it is your thing. I'll see you over there.

